.TH CUT_MOVE_TO 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
CUT_MOVE_TO \- CutStep initializer: ease the Vec2 that p points to from its current position to (x, y) over sec seconds with ease_in_out_quad
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcutscene.h\(dq
.ft B
#define CUT_MOVE_TO(p, x, y, sec) { .kind = CUT_MOVE, .actor = (p), .to = { (x), (y) }, .duration = (sec) }
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
CutStep initializer: ease the Vec2 that p points to from its current position to (x, y) over sec seconds with ease_in_out_quad. p is usually the pos of an entity in GameState, so this step must be built at run time (see CutStep).
.SH MODULE
cutscene (src/engine/cutscene/cutscene.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR CutStep (3),
.BR cutscene_start (3),
.BR ease_in_out_quad (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
